SUMMARY:Memory Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a monthly activity for people with dementia 
 and their caregivers. Memory Cafes host activities designed to engage in 
 the present\, without the expectations of using short-term memory or 
 forward thinking. This month\, we're going to the beach! Weather 
 permitting\, we'll be outside enjoying the sounds of the beach and playing 
 in kinetic sand. In the case of inclement weather\, we'll move the party 
 indoors! \n\nIf you have any accessibility questions or accommodation 
 needs\, please contact me at dpeterson@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests 
 be made at least three (3) business days prior to the event to ensure we 
 can provide the best accommodations possible! Please email me if you plan 
 to attend and have nut allergies so that we can make accommodations.
LOCATION:North Regional - Children's Programming Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Desiree Peterson":MAILTO:dpeterson@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Health & Fitness
