DTSTAMP:20260509T000000Z
SUMMARY:Learn to Sew with Connecting with Threads
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to use a sewing machine and hand sew with Connecting 
 with Threads. This is a series of programs where teens and tweens will be 
 able to build their knowledge as they become independent sewers. Other 
 dates in this series are as follows: April 11\, April 25\, May 9\, May 23\, 
 June 6\, and June 20. This program is for teens and tweens ages 9 and up! 
