SUMMARY:Your Digital Will
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an informative session on protecting and managing 
 your digital legacy. This program is ideal for anyone with online accounts 
 who wants to ensure their digital assets are managed according to their 
 wishes.\n\nParticipants will learn what digital will is\, why it is an 
 essential part of modern estate planning\, and how to create an organized 
 inventory of online accounts. The session will also cover appointing a 
 digital executor\, protecting sensitive information\, and outlining clear 
 instructions for managing digital assets.\n\nThrough guided discussion and 
 practical tips\, attendees will leave with the tools needed to begin 
 creating their own digital will\, helping safeguard important information 
 and provide peace of mind for themselves and their loved ones.\n\n \n\nFor 
 more information\, please call: 919-560-8594
LOCATION:Southwest Meeting Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Jason Howard":MAILTO:jchoward@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Digital/Tech Literacy
