 a practice session\, it is a live and public rehearsal! It is a chance to 
 see the artistry of planning a performance up close.\n\nThe dance group 
 will be moving throughout the library rehearsing from 6:00 p.m. to 7:45 
 p.m. Explore your library and find us! Whether you're browsing the stacks 
 or passing through the lobby\, feel free to stop and watch the creative 
 process unfold in real-time.\n\nWe appreciate your energy and flexibility 
 as we turn our everyday environment into a dynamic rehearsal 
 space!\n\n\n\n\nMay 13\, 20\, & 27\, 2026\n\nFOL Reading Lounge / 
 Children’s Programming Room / Auditorium / History Lounge / Innovation 
 Lab Stairs\n\n\nThis event is brought to you by Durham Library Foundation.
LOCATION:Main Library - Innovation Lab Stairs\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
