SUMMARY:IBS Myth-Busting Talk: It's Not All in Your Head
DESCRIPTION:"Do I just need more fiber?"\n\n"Will I ever be able to eat 
 garlic again?"\n\n"Will probiotics fix everything?"\n\n"Is IBS all in my 
 head?"\n\nThese are just a few of the common myths surrounding Irritable 
 Bowel Syndrome (IBS). Join us for a practical and engaging workshop to 
 break these myths down and explore what the science actually says. Learn 
 how fiber\, FODMAPs\, and probiotics affect IBS and feel more confident 
 navigating nutrition choices that support gut health!\n\nThis workshop is 
 presented by licensed and registered dietitian Lucy Hayhurst\, founder of 
 Well Balanced Nutrition.
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Austin Daniels":MAILTO:ausdaniels@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Business, Food & Cooking, Health & Fitness
